events.description:
We have scheduled a&nbsp;Del&nbsp;Valle&nbsp;public outreach/club star party for July 25, 2026. &nbsp;Sunset is about 8:20. Set up starts at 8:00. The public portion of the event will go from 8:30 to 10:00 to accommodate the park closing time.
&nbsp;
The star party will be at the Arroyo Road Staging Area, just past 5055 Arroyo Road. This location is NOT at the&nbsp;Del&nbsp;Valle&nbsp;main entrance, but is on Arroyo Road (an extension of L Street), past the golf course and turnoff to Veterans Hospital. &nbsp;
&nbsp;
Weather permitting, we should have good views of the Moon (almost full) and the usual Summer deep sky objects.&nbsp; The location is fairly dark for being so close to Livermore.
&nbsp;
I hope we get several club members with scopes or binoculars. If you don&rsquo;t have a telescope or binoculars you want to share, please come out to enjoy the views.Please let me know if you plan to bring a telescope or binoculars, so I know how many to expect. We need several scopes to make this a successful event.&nbsp;
Thanks.&nbsp;
Coordinates:(37.6196638, -121.7528899)
